examples.solution_text:
Write the fractions in eighths.
$\frac{3}{4}=\frac{6}{8}$
$\frac{1}{2}=\frac{4}{8}$
$\frac{1}{8}<\frac{4}{8}<\frac{6}{8}$
$\frac{1}{8}<\frac{1}{2}<\frac{3}{4}$
Divide the interval from $0$ to $1$ into eight equal parts. Mark the first, fourth and sixth division points.
